/*
 * Declares the DelegateValue class.
 *
 * DelegateValue represents the abstract base for all delegate constructions. A
 * delegate is composed of a function pointer and an associated closure context.
 * Different concrete subclasses implement the various ways a delegate may be
 * created:
 * 
 *   - from a proper closure,
 *   - from a method reference,
 *   - from a class constructor,
 *   - from template-based delegate constructions,
 *   - from synthetic or compiler-generated method wrappers.
 *   
